        {
          "id": "691e0edd88d826e1f614d539",
          "question": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A proton and an \\( \\alpha \\)-particle enter a uniform magnetic field at right angles to it with same velocity. The time period of \\( \\alpha \\)-particle as compared to that of proton, will be :</p>",
