        {
          "id": "69266e40a6d38edcb17cb2e5",
          "question": "<p>A positively charged particle having charge \\(q\\) and mass \\(m\\) enters in isosceles right angle triangular region having uniform magnetic field \\(B\\) as shown in gravity free space. The maximum value of \\(v\\) so that particle must comes out through the region from side PQ is<br /><img title=\"Screenshot 2023-06-06 130156.png\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5b09189f7285894d9130ccd0/j2fysylt2uu284y0ezsg37wko.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"236\" height=\"221\" /></p>",
          "image_url": "https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5b09189f7285894d9130ccd0/j2fysylt2uu284y0ezsg37wko.png",
          "images": [
