        {
          "id": "69266e40a6d38edcb17cb2eb",
          "question": "<p>A uniform current is flowing along the length of an infinite, straight, thin, hollow cylinder of radius 'R'. The magnetic field 'B' produced at a perpendicular distance 'd' from the axis of the cylinder is plotted in a graph. Which of the following figures looks like the plot?</p>",
