          "explanation": "<p><img style=\"width: 1.20835in; height: 1.19306in;\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5b09189f7285894d9130ccd0/bp7r4zknqhwl19ui6vyxrmox5.png\" /></p>\n<p>From the above figure, we can see that</p>\n<p>For <span class=\"math inline\">\\(d\\&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt; \\ R\\)</span>,</p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(B \\times 2\\pi d = \\mu_{0}I_{\\text{in}} = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(B = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>For <span class=\"math inline\">\\(d\\&nbsp;&nbsp;&gt; \\ R\\)</span>,</p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(B \\times 2\\pi d = \\mu_{0}I\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(B = \\frac{\\mu_{0}I}{2\\pi d}\\)</span></p>"
